    <!--
      "List Host" is the same shape for a component list's rows: List Slot
      holds a list of one Row, whose machine tracks its hover, and has a down
      listener of its own. The opaque List Overlay covers the row's right
      half; it is the first child, so it draws on top.
          List Slot     x 20..240, y 20..68
          List Overlay  x 130..240, y 20..68
    -->
